            "steam_appid": 467340,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467340/extras/6df15823d868b65b6668bf5ecb0f724d.webp?t=1483281973\" width=232 height=44 /></span><br>Star Surveyor is an exploration game about discovering a foreign planet, and observing the lives of its alien inhabitants.  <br>You're sent to Maya-247 with a simple mission: use your scanner to gather data about all of the flora and fauna you can, and send that data back to Earth.<br>Along the way you'll unlock upgrades to your suit which allow you to delve deeper under the planet's surface.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467340/extras/0ea6e00d8b01a24634b72ac41dd22ad2.webp?t=1483281973\" width=216 height=44 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A hand-crafted world<br></li><li>5 different biomes that are home to their own unique creatures<br></li><li>A host of suit upgrades that allow you to explore your environment in different ways<br></li><li>Creatures that require observation and patience to scan<br></li><li>Frogs</li></ul>",
